.RE
.SS Threads
.TP
\f[B]\-\-io\-threads\f[R]=\f[I]N\f[R]
Number of threads for the I/O\-bound stages (directory walk, file
hashing, dedupe).
By default \f[CR]oans\f[R] inspects the scan target\(cqs backing storage
and chooses automatically: the host CPU count capped at \f[B]8\f[R] for
non\-rotational disks (SSD/NVMe) or unknown media; fewer for a single
